2. Definitions.___(1) In this Act, unless there is anything repugnant in the subject or context,-
(a) “creditor” includes a decree-holder, “debt” includes a judgment-debt, and “debtor” includes a judgment-debtor ;
(b) “District Court” means the principal Civil Court of original jurisdiction in any area outside the limits of the ordinary original civil jurisdiction of the High Court of Sind as defined in section 2 of the Insolvency (Karachi Division and Dacca) Act (III of 1909);
(c) “prescribed” means prescribed by rules made under this Act ;
(d) “property” includes any property over which or the profits of which any person as a disposing power, which he may exercise for his own benefit ;

